# ── Real customer data — NEVER commit ───────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is public. Everything below contains either live credentials
# or personal data belonging to real customers, which makes committing it a
# breach under both Egyptian and Saudi PDPL, not merely untidy.
#
#   api_response.txt              live Bitrix REST token in deal_info_endpoint,
#                                 plus a customer's name and CRM contact id
#   fixtures/chats/*.json         same payload
#   fixtures/calls/*.wav          recordings of real customers' voices
#   docs/samples/*.json           verbatim transcripts and phone numbers
#   docs/call-evaluation.html     rendered transcript
#
# Keep them on local disk. See fixtures/README.md for how to populate them.
api_response.txt
fixtures/chats/
fixtures/calls/
docs/samples/
docs/call-evaluation.html
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg

# Internal design docs that quote the live payload
build-spec.html
customer-360-explained.html
schema-map.html
schema.html
final-erd.html
*.pdf
*.docx

